    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1362">

                <pb facs="1066" n="950" xml:id="pg950"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 812.512/868.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to Special Agent
                    Belt</hi>.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1915-11-01">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">November 1, 1915</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>You are instructed to take up with General Carranza question of payment mining
                    and other taxes in territory not under control of recognized de facto
                    government, and ask that manner in which Americans may be fully protected
                    against losses in this respect be clearly indicated. Endeavor to obtain
                    immediate reply, as Department receiving inquiries relating thereto.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Lansing.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
